ertility #MensHealth https://t.co/xsgD1v5Scj", "url": "https://x.com/naturalpathnews/status/2120631905729101879"}, {"author_id": "1522831972929781760", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:26:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120629199266595243"], "id": "2120629199266595243", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 24, "impression_count": 2022, "like_count": 84, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Aries, Leo Sagittarius\n\nChanneled Messages ✨\n\nLearn to control your emotions\nCongratulations in advance\nAnother person is involved\nThis connection is one-sided for a reason\nClean out your closet/giveaway unwanted clothes\nSpeaking up more for yourself\nReceiving good karma\nYou’re", "url": "https://x.com/DoseofTarot/status/2120629199266595243"}, {"author_id": "3385553633", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:30:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120630170423853297"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Maca is prized for improving longevity & fertility, and for treating ailments. Learn about Maca's health benefits, side effects, and Nutritional value.", "display_url": "eatperu.com/maca-benefits-…", "end": 232, "expanded_url": "https://www.eatperu.com/maca-benefits-nutrition/", "images": [{"height": 683, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120630215596556288/LN4ntkHE?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120630215596556288/LN4ntkHE?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 209, "status": 200, "title": "Maca - Benefits, Nutrition & Side Effects - Eat Peru", "unwound_url": "https://www.eatperu.com/maca-benefits-nutrition/", "url": "https://t.co/X98LRXp5Zt"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/p75U68vGhb", "end": 256, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EatPeru/status/2120630170423853297/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120539693280374784", "start": 233, "url": "https://t.co/p75U68vGhb"}]}, "id": "2120630170423853297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Andes have used maca, sometimes called Peruvian ginseng, for over two thousand years for longevity and fertility, and modern research is starting to back it up. Maca benefits, nutrition, and side effects: https://t.co/X98LRXp5Zt https://t.co/p75U68vGhb", "url": "https://x.com/EatPeru/status/2120630170423853297"}, {"author_id": "2686186026", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:49:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120635091063824422"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/TheFP/status/2…", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheFP/status/2120542121375740020", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/4TPnDLYAMD"}]}, "id": "2120635091063824422", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120542121375740020", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The lack of availability of grandparental childcare is DEFINITELY a factor in fertility declines. But the top reasons this care is less available aren't very fun culture war fodder: geographic distance, longer spacing between generations, and grandmothers more likely in workforce https://t.co/4TPnDLYAMD", "url": "https://x.com/trash_ebooks/status/2120635091063824422"}, {"author_id": "105144646", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:34:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120631174573756621"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "ift.tt/fYjaUD6", "end": 214, "expanded_url": "https://ift.tt/fYjaUD6", "start": 191, "unwound_url": "https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.saesalute.it%2Fnews%2Fdonna%2Fmaternita-in-italia-sette-anni-tra-desiderio-e-realta%2F273&h=AUDxYeZOykHwfNz_ZyXvI1k_YxxTWa62ZupTGsxfLsZwLpzoJypd6HUHt6fAk-imRes8WSBhR8Nx2lrtjGUlcPT4pSYnsXMHMdxVxdwsZW3cwCNhEw4kMXnTb27zBEMT&s=1", "url": "https://t.co/IYOWMZHLXs"}]}, "id": "2120631174573756621", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Il tempo biologico e le scelte delle donne non sempre coincidono: il Fertility Barometer 2026 rivela che nel nostro Paese il 46% delle madri lo è diventato più tardi di quanto avrebbe voluto https://t.co/IYOWMZHLXs", "url": "https://x.com/provinciapavese/status/2120631174573756621"}, {"author_id": "1861734988317679616", "created_at": "2026-11-11T22:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120637702873706995"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "In 2024, the total fertility rate in children per woman worldwide was 2.19. Between 1960 and 2024, the figure dropped by 2.5, though the decline followed an uneven course rather than a steady trajectory.", "display_url": "statista.com/statistics/806…", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://statista.com/statistics/806110/fertility-rate-in-the-arab-world/", "start": 255, "status": 200, "title": "Total fertility rate in children per woman worldwide 2024 | Statista", "unwound_url": "https://www.statista.com/statistics/806110/fertility-rate-in-the-arab-world/", "url": "https://t.co/k4bqruk1M0"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/1FvcwZRaEc", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/makeLOVEfamily/status/2120637702873706995/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2087630456460087296", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/1FvcwZRaEc"}]}, "id": "2120637702873706995", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We need to make love more — fewer and fewer children are being born every year.\n\nIn 2024, the global fertility rate was 2.19 children per woman. Between 1960 and 2024, that figure dropped by 2.5.\n\nChildren are the future.\nLet's have more children.\n\nLink:\nhttps://t.co/k4bqruk1M0 https://t.co/1FvcwZRaEc", "url": "https://x.com/makeLOVEfamily/status/2120637702873706995"}, {"author_id": "2065151829751762944", "created_at": "2026-11-11T21:51:37.000Z", "edit_history_t